---
description: >-
  A container view in c4-beta: a group nested in a software system
  boundary, an external system, a cylinder by tag style and four
  relations.
---
c4-beta container
title Internet Banking - Containers
person customer "Personal Customer" "A customer of the bank."
softwareSystem banking "Internet Banking" {
    group web "Web tier" {
        container spa "Single-Page App" "Shows the accounts." "TypeScript"
        container api "API Application" "Serves account data." "Kotlin"
    }
    container db "Database" "Stores accounts." "PostgreSQL" :::store
}
softwareSystem mainframe "Mainframe Banking" "Holds the core data." :::external
style store shape:cylinder
customer --> spa : "Uses" "HTTPS"
spa --> api : "Calls" "JSON/HTTPS"
api --> db : "Reads and writes" "SQL"
api --> mainframe : "Reads accounts from" "XML/HTTPS"
